---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-stone-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-600 text-white">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-brand-900">Guia Morada</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Registro de imobiliárias e corretores em cada cidade do Brasil. Busque profissionais perto de você ou anuncie o seu negócio no diretório.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-900">Explorar</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-muted">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Início</a></li>
          <li><a href="/imobiliarias/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Imobiliárias</a></li>
          <li><a href="/construtoras/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Construtoras</a></li>
          <li><a href="/corretores/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Corretores</a></li>
          <li><a href="/anuncie/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Anuncie aqui</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sobre/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Sobre nós</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contato/" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">Contato</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-900">Contato</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-muted">
          <li><a href="mailto:contato@guiamorada.com" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">contato@guiamorada.com</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5548988105199" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-brand-700 transition">
              WhatsApp +55 48 98810-5199
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-stone-100 pt-8 sm:flex-row">
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">&copy; {year} Guia Morada. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">CRECI verificado</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
